    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a country plagued by greed and violence, a government-hired mercenary is tasked with recovering a mysterious jewel with hidden powers. Driven by the promise of wealth, he embarks on a mission that quickly spirals out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During his journey, a native warrior seeking revenge and a corrupt banker with hidden motives cross his path, complicating the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the wrongful possession of the jewel may lead to the world\u2019s destruction, revealing that greed holds the power to alter the course of humanity. <br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense action with strategic depth in close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile dodges and counterattacks for fast-paced duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short- and long-range weapons, each with unique styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Ultimate meter that charges to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special techniques enabling aerial combos and enemy guard breaks. <br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade shop to unlock new moves, special abilities, and improve attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive AI: enemies learn from the player, studying behavior to make each fight unique and challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized look inspired by western comic books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal cinematic finishers and Quick Time Events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies with unique reactions, doses of dark humor, and strong cultural references.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a country plagued by greed and violence, a government-hired mercenary is tasked with recovering a mysterious jewel with hidden powers. Driven by the promise of wealth, he embarks on a mission that quickly spirals out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During his journey, a native warrior seeking revenge and a corrupt banker with hidden motives cross his path, complicating the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the wrongful possession of the jewel may lead to the world\u2019s destruction, revealing that greed holds the power to alter the course of humanity. <br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense action with strategic depth in close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile dodges and counterattacks for fast-paced duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short- and long-range weapons, each with unique styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Ultimate meter that charges to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special techniques enabling aerial combos and enemy guard breaks. <br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade shop to unlock new moves, special abilities, and improve attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive AI: enemies learn from the player, studying behavior to make each fight unique and challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized look inspired by western comic books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal cinematic finishers and Quick Time Events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies with unique reactions, doses of dark humor, and strong cultural references.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A town without a sheriff is the least of your problems when there\u2019s a bounty on your head.",
